rumc-world-event-MineClosed = A mine was closed on the neighbouring planet: ore, sheets and crystals are getting dearer.
rumc-world-event-NewVein = A rich deposit was found by the neighbours: the price of ore is falling.
rumc-world-event-AmmoStrike = A strike at the ammunition plant: cartridges and weapons are getting dearer.
rumc-world-event-OilShock = An oil shock in the far systems: fuel is getting much dearer.
rumc-world-event-FuelGlut = Fuel is overproduced: prices are falling.
rumc-world-event-MarketCrash = A crash of the exchange: everything is getting cheaper, the companies cut their buying.
rumc-world-event-DemandBoom = A boom of demand at the centre: the companies buy up everything, prices are rising.
rumc-world-event-StormVoyage = A storm in space: the voyages are put off.
